{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:173","content":{"id":173,"title":"16 宇宙最大的图书馆","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e9a73263-aeee-4749-91be-5691abb2f67b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"适应性免疫系统为世上所有可能的敌人，包括过去曾出现过的、现有存世的，甚至将来可能出现但目前还不存在的感染，都准备了专门的武器。总之，它拥有全宇宙最大的图书馆。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fbd924c0-e923-44bc-8b32-e2fbe3d2760a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"细菌会适应人体的防御系统，并变成病原体，甚至在感染的过程中，细菌还会变异，仅靠先天性免疫系统不够。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d6e44c61-5b00-4009-9b8f-2a49d0924169","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要有适应性、针对性的武器。免疫系统不怎么适应新入侵者，而是在刚出生时就具备适应性，预装载了几亿不同的免疫细胞，应对此生可能面临的威胁。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第二部分，惨重损伤"},{"label":"16 宇宙最大的图书馆","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:173","type":"doc","id":173}}],"prevPage":{"title":"15 超级武器降临","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:172","type":"doc","id":172}},"nextPage":{"title":"17 烹饪美味的受体菜谱","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:174","type":"doc","id":174}},"createTime":1740015719566,"updateTime":1756124012866,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1756124012866}}